<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Mint Oreo vs. Standard Oreo Blizzard</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">standard Oreo Blizzard</a> and the Mint Oreo Blizzard use the same Oreo cookie pieces blended into DQ soft serve. The difference is one ingredient: cool mint flavoring added to the Mint Oreo that transforms the standard cookie-cream flavor into a mint-chocolate-cookie profile. Think of the difference between a regular Oreo and a Mint Oreo cookie — then translate that into a Blizzard. See both and all other Blizzard flavors on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mint Oreo Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~440</td><td>Oreo crunch + cool mint layer</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Oreo Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>420</td><td>Pure cookie-cream, no mint</td></tr><tr><td>Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~480</td><td>Cocoa + peppermint — winter seasonal</td></tr><tr><td>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>510</td><td>Intense chocolate, no mint</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Mint Oreo Blizzard — Ordering Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>First timer?</strong> Start with the standard <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Blizzard</a> to establish the baseline, then try Mint Oreo on your next visit to understand the mint addition.</li>
    <li><strong>Prefer stronger mint?</strong> Ask your DQ crew if additional mint flavoring can be added — some locations accommodate this request.</li>
    <li><strong>Good for summer visits</strong> — The mint flavor adds a refreshing coolness to the cold soft serve that feels especially good on hot days.</li>
    <li><strong>Pair with a burger</strong> — The mint Blizzard works as a palate cleanser after the bold flavors of a <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">FlameThrower Stackburger</a>.</li>
  </ul>

